WEBVTT

00:23:27.458 --> 00:23:30.393
so I was hoping to surprise her
with something creative.

00:23:30.417 --> 00:23:33.559
I'm feeling a little bit
of the butterflies right now.

00:23:33.583 --> 00:23:35.726
Hi there, how's it going?

00:23:35.750 --> 00:23:38.101
Anthony: Welcome to Cinnabon,
how can I help you?

00:23:38.125 --> 00:23:39.434
AG: Thank you, I'm Adam.

00:23:39.458 --> 00:23:41.434
Anthony: Hello, Adam, my name's Anthony.

00:23:41.458 --> 00:23:44.101
AG: What do you like most
about working here?

00:23:44.125 --> 00:23:46.434
Anthony: The environment is very nice.

00:23:46.458 --> 00:23:48.184
Mini buns are a ton of fun to make.

00:23:48.208 --> 00:23:50.018
AG: So the smell doesn't get old?

00:23:50.042 --> 00:23:51.768
Anthony: Oh no, it doesn't get old,

00:23:51.792 --> 00:23:54.143
but I still have to control
myself every so often.

00:23:54.167 --> 00:23:57.518
AG: Alright, so Anthony,
here's my mission today.

00:23:57.542 --> 00:24:01.393
I was wondering if there's any way
you could possibly make me a taco.